NOTE 选段剪辑、压缩、字幕断句及中文翻译：aiai 学院；视频片段及双语字幕按 CC BY-SA 3.0 NL 发布。

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.360
冯雁: So that they can work with us better. They can help us better.
这样，它们才能更好地与我们合作，更好地帮助我们。

2
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:14.330
冯雁: If they need to take care of us, take care of our children, our elderly, they really need to understand our true intent and emotion in order to take care of us. Say if you go to the hospital
如果它们要照顾我们，照顾孩子或老人，就确实需要理解我们的真实意图和情绪，才能照顾好我们。比如，你去了医院，

3
00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:33.870
冯雁: there's a nurse and what a nurse does is not just to take your temperature and look at your vital signs but also talk to you and see how you are doing and whether you need comforting, whether you need water, whether you need medicine at this point in time, so that requires emotional intelligence and it requires empathy.
那里有一位护士。护士所做的，不只是测量体温、查看生命体征，还会与你交谈，看看你的情况如何，是否需要安慰，是否需要喝水，或者此刻是否需要药物。这需要情绪智能，也需要共情。

4
00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:40.910
采访者: Is it because they are becoming closer to us or because there is a difference of environment?
这是因为它们越来越贴近我们，还是因为环境有所不同？

5
00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:48.660
冯雁: Yes the robots are coming more into our lives, into our daily lives and there will be more robots around us.
是的，机器人正越来越多地进入我们的生活、进入日常生活。我们身边会有更多机器人。

6
00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:54.750
冯雁: If they don't have emotional intelligence they are more likely to make mistakes and even hurt us.
如果它们不具备情绪智能，就更容易犯错，甚至伤害我们。

7
00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.390
采访者: There are a lot of different kinds of emotions.
情绪有很多不同的种类。

8
00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.790
采访者: What kind of emotions should they express or should they at least recognize?
它们应该表达什么样的情绪？或者至少应该识别哪些情绪？

9
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:17.540
冯雁: For example the very first thing we're working on for robots to recognize includes whether the human is happy, angry, sad, or frustrated or hesitating or even sense of humor.
例如，我们最先研究让机器人识别的内容包括：人是否，开心、生气、悲伤、沮丧，或犹豫，甚至还包括幽默感。

10
00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:21.660
冯雁: One of my students is working on recognizing sense of humor.
我的一名学生就在研究识别幽默感。
